{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓團Big Bang前成員T.O.P（崔勝鉉）上月初認愛女星NaNa後，流失不少粉絲，營運了20年的粉絲網站「崔勝鉉.com」亦於上月9日宣布關閉。</p><p>而T.O.P前日發長文道歉，感謝粉絲一直以來的支持。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:42:26.905634+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T01:21:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:38:56.045621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T01:38:56.045621+00:00","content_hash":"542a816fc3516dc980d9da7eba94ce3da4b7f59507f4be12c5fe7189466834ce","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}